      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Legend:\n  Blue solid = request flow (downstream)\n  Green dashed = response (upstream)\n  Orange dashed = async fire-and-forget (click event to Kafka)\n  Pink = cache layer interactions (Redis SET / GET)\n  Note: phases A, B, C illustrate the 3 hot/warm/cold redirect outcomes. Most production traffic is mix of A+B.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 70,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Legend:\n  Blue solid = request flow (downstream)\n  Green dashed = response (upstream)\n  Orange dashed = async fire-and-forget (click event to Kafka)\n  Pink = cache layer interactions (Redis SET / GET)\n  Note: phases A, B, C illustrate the 3 hot/warm/cold redirect outcomes. Most production traffic is mix of A+B.",
